    <string name="page_terminal_titre">A terminal in your pocket</string>
    <string name="page_terminal_texte">CodeIDE can install a complete Linux environment: shell, JDK and command-line tools, to build and run your projects directly on the device — no computer needed.</string>
    <string name="page_terminal_poids">About 40 MB to download, then several hundred MB installed (the repository currently provides the JDK and git; Gradle and the Android SDK will follow).</string>
    <string name="page_terminal_installer">Install now</string>
    <string name="page_terminal_deja_installe">The terminal tools are already installed.</string>
